OL,3,GNEWSABehind bars: Drugs and
OL,4,Aillegally-brewed alcohol
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrug seizures at an English prison have
OL,7,Fmore than doubled over a year, as staff
OL,8,Fcontinue to battle against "widespread"
OL,9,Fsubstance abuse.
OL,11,FA report by independent monitors has
OL,12,Frevealed that in February, half of all
OL,13,Fprisoners subjected to mandatory drug
OL,14,Ftests at HMP Winchester in Hampshire
OL,15,Ftested positive.
OL,17,FPrisoners are also brewing "hooch", a
OL,18,Fpotent alcohol made by fermenting foods
OL,19,Fsuch as fruit and sugar. Hundreds of
OL,20,Flitres were confiscated in the 12
OL,21,Fmonths up to the end of May.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
